# algorithms (secondary structure, partial charges, molecular surface). The
# runtime never imports it; see LICENSE § "Third-Party Components" for the
# BSD-3-Clause attribution that the ported source files carry inline.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/3Dmol.js-master/
/3Dmol.js-master.zip

